    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d578">

                <pb facs="0657" n="647" sameAs="frus:frus1943China/pg647"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.20 Defense (M)/11662b: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Gauss</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-01-20T23:00:00-04:00">January 20,
                            1943—11 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>108. Can you ascertain whether antimony is being acquired by Japanese from
                    unoccupied China and if so in what amounts; also whether Soviet Russia is
                    purchasing antimony from CNRC and transporting overland?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
